      "message": "dev_info() has been changed into dev_err().\n\nA dev_err() statement has been inserted instead of a tracepoint because if this code path is hit we want the message to appear in the kernel log. Kernel logs are included in RAM dumps. Additionally, at the time a RAM dump is created it is too late to go back in time and to enable a tracepoint.",
